WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.805
In this tutorial we set up a tiny demo project in the terminal.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.078
First, type this command in the terminal and run it.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.129
You should see the words project ready.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.119
Next, paste this prompt into the prompt box.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.332
The assistant answers with a short poem.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.947
Then copy your API key into the settings panel.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.579
Finally, click run to see the result.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.519
That is the whole workflow.
